{"id":2886,"name":"Tenchi Muyou! Ryououki 3rd Season","slug":"tenchi_muyou_ryououki_3rd_season","synopsis":"Continuing right where the last OVA series left off, the mysterious Lady Tokimi dispatches the warrior Z to Earth in order to learn more about Tenchi and his connection to Washu and Tsunami. Z is ordered not to lay a hand on Tenchi, but he may have his own agenda as he quickly sets about making trouble for our hero. Meanwhile, Tenchi's father and grandfather come to the decision that it may be time for Tenchi to learn even more about his past and his Jurian heritage. And the arrival of a couple of new female residents to the Masaki household threatens to upset the balance and inflame the rivalry over Tenchi's already decidedly divided affection.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)","format":"OVA","season":"SUMMER","year":2003,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:41","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 08:39:04","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":541},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":541},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":500},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":2510},{"site":"ANN","externalId":922},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":3221},{"site":"HULU","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":5757,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/UmXC2tAD0yIt6jJzjSGLItFpSdxiiyiuezwyOi0T.jpg"},{"id":5758,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/sSnpg9trSjU8QjNQLvqq9FMicO5Dw868Myk6Flky.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":20,"name":"AIC","slug":"aic"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":162,"name":"Tenchi Muyou!","slug":"tenchi_muyou"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":1716,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":1716,"title":"Tenchi Muyou! Ryououki Dai San Ki Theme","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":1891,"version":1,"episodes":"1-3","nsfw":true,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":660,"basename":"TenchiMuyouRyououkiS3-OP1.webm","filename":"TenchiMuyouRyououkiS3-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/TenchiMuyouRyououkiS3-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":3